  "reason": "Existing evidence shows that multiprofile multimodal models with scvi_n200 RNA and resnet50 image encoders (config_031) achieve high accuracy (0.6776). This experiment tests replacing resnet50 with imagenet_vit_l while keeping RNA encoder, aggregation (avgpool), and fusion (weighted) consistent. It isolates the impact of image encoder quality on performance, addressing uncertainty about whether ViT's superior image representation could further improve results. This comparison directly tests a key design choice with minimal parameter changes, leveraging prior success in multiprofile settings."
}

